        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your new adventure begins here!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue your journey where the road becomes your home and every new day is a chapter in your book of memories! Explore the vast expanses of North America, enjoying freedom and the most scenic views. Your motorhome is a ticket to a world full of discoveries and heartfelt moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097080/extras/338366cd711cd89812606f65fed6f89e.poster.avif?t=1772655986\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097080/extras/338366cd711cd89812606f65fed6f89e.webm?t=1772655986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097080/extras/338366cd711cd89812606f65fed6f89e.mp4?t=1772655986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover stunning national parks, breathtaking ski resorts, majestic canyons, and many other iconic US locations. Enjoy the ride while completing engaging hidden-object tasks with innovative mechanics and solving clever puzzles. Collect unique souvenirs from different states – your personal collection of memories from the great journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, explore, relax!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore America via the scenic route,</strong> enjoying the freedom of the road and the most beautiful places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve new puzzles</strong> and play exciting mini-games while collecting unique souvenirs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet a funny raccoon</strong> in bonus locations – he knows where the most interesting finds are hidden!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097080/extras/aa4388b5c73c46f33ee97abdd129bc4b.poster.avif?t=1772655986\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097080/extras/aa4388b5c73c46f33ee97abdd129bc4b.webm?t=1772655986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097080/extras/aa4388b5c73c46f33ee97abdd129bc4b.mp4?t=1772655986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collector's Edition — Even More Coziness and Adventure!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 additional locations</strong> — find even more hidden objects and meet a funny raccoon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 new mini-games + 12 additional puzzles</strong> — a real challenge for logic lovers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A collection of unique souvenirs</strong> — 20 exclusive memorabilia from your trip!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful wallpapers and a music player</strong> — decorate your desktop with magnificent landscapes and listen to atmospheric tracks on the road!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for a new dream road trip? Start your engine – ahead lie endless landscapes, warm memories, and the spirit of true adventure!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your new adventure begins here!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue your journey where the road becomes your home and every new day is a chapter in your book of memories! Explore the vast expanses of North America, enjoying freedom and the most scenic views. Your motorhome is a ticket to a world full of discoveries and heartfelt moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097080/extras/338366cd711cd89812606f65fed6f89e.poster.avif?t=1772655986\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097080/extras/338366cd711cd89812606f65fed6f89e.webm?t=1772655986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097080/extras/338366cd711cd89812606f65fed6f89e.mp4?t=1772655986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover stunning national parks, breathtaking ski resorts, majestic canyons, and many other iconic US locations. Enjoy the ride while completing engaging hidden-object tasks with innovative mechanics and solving clever puzzles. Collect unique souvenirs from different states – your personal collection of memories from the great journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, explore, relax!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore America via the scenic route,</strong> enjoying the freedom of the road and the most beautiful places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve new puzzles</strong> and play exciting mini-games while collecting unique souvenirs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet a funny raccoon</strong> in bonus locations – he knows where the most interesting finds are hidden!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097080/extras/aa4388b5c73c46f33ee97abdd129bc4b.poster.avif?t=1772655986\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097080/extras/aa4388b5c73c46f33ee97abdd129bc4b.webm?t=1772655986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097080/extras/aa4388b5c73c46f33ee97abdd129bc4b.mp4?t=1772655986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collector's Edition — Even More Coziness and Adventure!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 additional locations</strong> — find even more hidden objects and meet a funny raccoon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 new mini-games + 12 additional puzzles</strong> — a real challenge for logic lovers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A collection of unique souvenirs</strong> — 20 exclusive memorabilia from your trip!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful wallpapers and a music player</strong> — decorate your desktop with magnificent landscapes and listen to atmospheric tracks on the road!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for a new dream road trip? Start your engine – ahead lie endless landscapes, warm memories, and the spirit of true adventure!</p>",
